/P 28 0 R
/E (     I am a member of the ASA Robotics Team, where I collaborate with colleagues to design and build fully functional robots from scratch for prestigious competitions, including the First Tech Challenge \(FTC\) and other national and international robotics championships. My technical competencies include programming in C++, Java, and Python for control algorithms and sensor integration, hands-on experience with electronics such as sensors, actuators, and microcontrollers, as well as CAD mechanical design and system integration. This experience has sharpened my analytical thinking, strengthened my perseverance, and enhanced my ability to communicate effectively across disciplines while remaining focused under pressure.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [37]
>>
